        "    internal-fsb-reusable-preset-name=\"feature_title\"",
        "    internal-fsb-translation=\"\"",
        "    internal-fsb-seo-emphasizer=\"h2\">Complete Bootstrap Studio</h2>",
        "<div",
        "    class=\"-fsb-self-49d77136 col-2 internal-fsb-allow-cursor internal-fsb-element internal-fsb-strict-layout offset-5\"",
        "    internal-fsb-class=\"FlowLayout\"",
        "    internal-fsb-event-no-propagate=\"1\"",
        "    internal-fsb-guid=\"49d77136\"",
        "    internal-fsb-name=\"HR\"",
        "    internal-fsb-reusable-preset-name=\"feature_hr\"",
        "    style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">",
        "",
        "</div>",
        "<h3",
        "    class=\"-fsb-self-d2a8edc9 col-10 internal-fsb-element offset-1\"",
        "    contenteditable=\"true\"",
        "    internal-fsb-class=\"TextElement\"",
        "    internal-fsb-event-no-propagate=\"1\"",
        "    internal-fsb-guid=\"d2a8edc9\"",
        "    internal-fsb-name=\"Description\"",
        "    internal-fsb-reusable-preset-name=\"feature_subtitle\"",
        "    internal-fsb-translation=\"\"",
        "    internal-fsb-seo-emphasizer=\"h3\">StackBlend is a software development Bootstrap Studio that offers a tool for designing and developing web applications. It allows users to work on both front-end and back-end development, UI/UX design, and content creation in a single studio. StackBlend Studio provides a collaborative and simplified development experience, with features like code reuse, and documentation. It also supports responsive design customization through integration with Bootstrap and offers extensive options for HTML5 and CSS3.</h3>",
        "",
        "</div>",
        "</div>",
        "<div",
        "    class=\"col-12 col-lg-4 col-md-6 internal-fsb-allow-cursor internal-fsb-element internal-fsb-strict-layout\"",
        "    internal-fsb-class=\"Column\"",
        "    internal-fsb-guid=\"996028c0\"",
        "    internal-fsb-name=\"Column\"",
        "    internal-fsb-event-no-propagate=\"1\"",
        "    style=\"display: flex\">",
        "<div",
        "    class=\"-fsb-preset-4d8aded9 internal-fsb-allow-cursor internal-fsb-element internal-fsb-strict-layout\"",
        "    internal-fsb-class=\"FlowLayout\"",
        "    internal-fsb-event-no-propagate=\"1\"",
        "    internal-fsb-guid=\"23639b67\"",
        "    internal-fsb-name=\"Detail Box\"",
        "    style=\"background: rgba(85, 85, 85, 1); display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; height: 100%\">",
        "",
        "<h2",
        "    class=\"-fsb-self-12662a17 col-12 internal-fsb-element\"",
        "    contenteditable=\"true\"",
        "    internal-fsb-class=\"TextElement\"",
        "    internal-fsb-event-no-propagate=\"1\"",
        "    internal-fsb-guid=\"12662a17\"",
        "    internal-fsb-name=\"Title\"",
        "    internal-fsb-reusable-preset-name=\"feature_title_smaller\"",
        "    internal-fsb-translation=\"\"",
        "    internal-fsb-seo-emphasizer=\"h2\">WYSIWYG</h2>",
        "<div",
        "    class=\"-fsb-preset-49d77136 col-4 internal-fsb-allow-cursor internal-fsb-element internal-fsb-strict-layout offset-4\"",
        "    internal-fsb-class=\"FlowLayout\"",
        "    internal-fsb-event-no-propagate=\"1\"",
        "    internal-fsb-guid=\"db75c1a9\"",
        "    internal-fsb-name=\"HR\"",
        "    style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;; min-height: 2px\">",
        "",
        "</div>",
        "<h3",
        "    class=\"-fsb-preset-d2a8edc9 col-12 internal-fsb-element\"",
        "    contenteditable=\"true\"",
        "    internal-fsb-class=\"TextElement\"",
        "    internal-fsb-event-no-propagate=\"1\"",
        "    internal-fsb-guid=\"b4964e4c\"",
        "    internal-fsb-name=\"Description\"",
        "    style=\"-fsb-inherited-presets: d2a8edc9\"",
        "    internal-fsb-translation=\"\"",
        "    internal-fsb-seo-emphasizer=\"h3\">You can design your website application without leaving the code editor, with full extensive options of HTML5 and CSS3 right from the Sidebar.<div>",
        "<br>",
        "</div>",
        "<div>StackBlend Studio is integrated with Bootstrap to support responsive design customization and also managed to handle cross-browser compatibilities for you.</div>",
        "</h3>",
        "</div>",
        "</div>",
        "<div",
        "    class=\"col-12 col-lg-4 col-md-6 internal-fsb-allow-cursor internal-fsb-element internal-fsb-strict-layout\"",
        "    internal-fsb-class=\"Column\"",
        "    internal-fsb-guid=\"d5e30c1d\"",
        "    internal-fsb-name=\"Column\"",
        "    internal-fsb-event-no-propagate=\"1\"",
        "    style=\"display: flex\">",
        "<div",
        "    class=\"-fsb-preset-4d8aded9 internal-fsb-allow-cursor internal-fsb-element internal-fsb-strict-layout\"",
        "    internal-fsb-class=\"FlowLayout\"",
        "    internal-fsb-event-no-propagate=\"1\"",
        "    internal-fsb-guid=\"3972ab47\"",
        "    internal-fsb-name=\"Detail Box\"",
        "    style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">",
        "",
        "<h2",
        "    class=\"-fsb-preset-12662a17 col-12 internal-fsb-element\"",
        "    contenteditable=\"true\"",
        "    internal-fsb-class=\"TextElement\"",
        "    internal-fsb-event-no-propagate=\"1\"",
        "    internal-fsb-guid=\"8b3eae6e\"",
        "    internal-fsb-name=\"Title\"",
        "    style=\"-fsb-inherited-presets: 12662a17\"",
        "    internal-fsb-translation=\"\"",
        "    internal-fsb-seo-emphasizer=\"h2\">Data Modeling</h2>",
        "<div",
        "    class=\"-fsb-preset-49d77136 col-4 internal-fsb-allow-cursor internal-fsb-element internal-fsb-strict-layout offset-4\"",
        "    internal-fsb-class=\"FlowLayout\"",
        "    internal-fsb-event-no-propagate=\"1\"",
        "    internal-fsb-guid=\"7838c35b\"",
        "    internal-fsb-name=\"HR\"",
        "    style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">",
        "",
        "</div>",
        "<h3",
        "    class=\"-fsb-preset-d2a8edc9 col-12 internal-fsb-element\"",
        "    contenteditable=\"true\"",
        "    internal-fsb-class=\"TextElement\"",
        "    internal-fsb-event-no-propagate=\"1\"",
        "    internal-fsb-guid=\"999a17e1\"",
        "    internal-fsb-name=\"Description\"",
        "    style=\"-fsb-inherited-presets: d2a8edc9\"",
        "    internal-fsb-translation=\"\"",
        "    internal-fsb-seo-emphasizer=\"h3\">StackBlend Studio uses its Data Modeling to define data schemata for linking datasets between front-end and back-end by simply using dot notations, together with restriction options, among tables to perform CRUD.<div>",
        "<br>",
        "</div>",
        "<div>Moreover, the dataset in-between are bonded together with the socket technology, so that they will synchronize without any extra code.</div>",
        "</h3>",
        "</div>",
        "</div>",
        "<div",
        "    class=\"col-12 col-lg-4 col-md-6 internal-fsb-allow-cursor internal-fsb-element internal-fsb-strict-layout\"",
        "    internal-fsb-class=\"Column\"",
        "    internal-fsb-guid=\"116e7c17\"",
        "    internal-fsb-name=\"Column\"",
        "    internal-fsb-event-no-propagate=\"1\"",
        "    style=\"display: flex\">",
        "<div",
        "    class=\"-fsb-preset-4d8aded9 internal-fsb-allow-cursor internal-fsb-element internal-fsb-strict-layout\"",
        "    internal-fsb-class=\"FlowLayout\"",
        "    internal-fsb-event-no-propagate=\"1\"",
        "    internal-fsb-guid=\"7d34a1c3\"",
        "    internal-fsb-name=\"Detail Box\"",
        "    style=\"background: rgba(85, 85, 85, 1); display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap\">",
        "",
        "<h2",
        "    class=\"-fsb-preset-12662a17 col-12 internal-fsb-element\"",
        "    contenteditable=\"true\"",
        "    internal-fsb-class=\"TextElement\"",
        "    internal-fsb-event-no-propagate=\"1\"",
        "    internal-fsb-guid=\"73ed0151\"",
        "    internal-fsb-name=\"Title\"",
        "    style=\"-fsb-inherited-presets: 12662a17\"",
        "    internal-fsb-translation=\"\"",
        "    internal-fsb-seo-emphasizer=\"h2\">Business Logic</h2>",
        "<div",
        "    class=\"-fsb-preset-49d77136 col-4 internal-fsb-allow-cursor internal-fsb-element internal-fsb-strict-layout offset-4\"",
        "    internal-fsb-class=\"FlowLayout\"",
        "    internal-fsb-event-no-propagate=\"1\"",
        "    internal-fsb-guid=\"ce65bb3d\"",
        "    internal-fsb-name=\"HR\"",
        "    style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">",
        "",
        "</div>",
        "<h3",
        "    class=\"-fsb-preset-d2a8edc9 col-12 internal-fsb-element\"",
        "    contenteditable=\"true\"",
        "    internal-fsb-class=\"TextElement\"",
        "    internal-fsb-event-no-propagate=\"1\"",
        "    internal-fsb-guid=\"1419c07c\"",
        "    internal-fsb-name=\"Description\"",
        "    style=\"-fsb-inherited-presets: d2a8edc9\"",
        "    internal-fsb-translation=\"\"",
        "    internal-fsb-seo-emphasizer=\"h3\">While using Node.JS and React.JS as a basis, you have full control of customization on the server-side and client-side by extending the main class or overriding its methods to complete all business requirements.<div>",
        "<br>",
        "</div>",
        "<div>StackBlend Studio also uses typed JavaScript to reduce development errors on both front-end and back-end, so that your apps will have fewer bugs.</div>",
        "</h3>",
        "</div>",
        "</div>",
        "<div",
        "    class=\"col-12 col-lg-4 col-md-6 internal-fsb-allow-cursor internal-fsb-element internal-fsb-strict-layout\"",
        "    internal-fsb-class=\"Column\"",
        "    internal-fsb-guid=\"2b32a990\"",
        "    internal-fsb-name=\"Column\"",
        "    internal-fsb-event-no-propagate=\"1\"",
        "    style=\"display: flex\">",
        "<div",
        "    class=\"-fsb-preset-4d8aded9 internal-fsb-allow-cursor internal-fsb-element internal-fsb-strict-layout\"",
        "    internal-fsb-class=\"FlowLayout\"",
        "    internal-fsb-event-no-propagate=\"1\"",
        "    internal-fsb-guid=\"6c44bea0\"",
        "    internal-fsb-name=\"Detail Box\"",
        "    style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">",
        "",
        "<h2",
        "    class=\"-fsb-preset-12662a17 col-12 internal-fsb-element\"",
        "    contenteditable=\"true\"",
        "    internal-fsb-class=\"TextElement\"",
        "    internal-fsb-event-no-propagate=\"1\"",
        "    internal-fsb-guid=\"a042535d\"",
        "    internal-fsb-name=\"Title\"",
        "    style=\"-fsb-inherited-presets: 12662a17\"",
        "    internal-fsb-translation=\"\"",
        "    internal-fsb-seo-emphasizer=\"h2\">User Experience</h2>",
        "<div",
        "    class=\"-fsb-preset-49d77136 col-4 internal-fsb-allow-cursor internal-fsb-element internal-fsb-strict-layout offset-4\"",
        "    internal-fsb-class=\"FlowLayout\"",
        "    internal-fsb-event-no-propagate=\"1\"",
        "    internal-fsb-guid=\"d530a1a9\"",
        "    internal-fsb-name=\"HR\"",
        "    style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">",
        "",
        "</div>",
        "<h3",
        "    class=\"-fsb-preset-d2a8edc9 col-12 internal-fsb-element\"",
        "    contenteditable=\"true\"",
        "    internal-fsb-class=\"TextElement\"",
        "    internal-fsb-event-no-propagate=\"1\"",
        "    internal-fsb-guid=\"c6b46e93\"",
        "    internal-fsb-name=\"Description\"",
        "    style=\"-fsb-inherited-presets: d2a8edc9\"",
        "    internal-fsb-translation=\"\"",
        "    internal-fsb-seo-emphasizer=\"h3\">Your designer can retouch the user interface and user experience with a light of touch which they can preview and deploy it without needs from a developer.<div>",
        "<br>",
        "</div>",
        "<div>Furthermore, a developer can convert any parent of elements to become a reusable component that your designer can placed them on any page, too.</div>",
        "</h3>",
        "</div>",
        "</div>",
        "<div",
        "    class=\"col-12 col-lg-4 col-md-6 internal-fsb-allow-cursor internal-fsb-element internal-fsb-strict-layout\"",
        "    internal-fsb-class=\"Column\"",
        "    internal-fsb-guid=\"acedaec8\"",
        "    internal-fsb-name=\"Column\"",
        "    internal-fsb-event-no-propagate=\"1\"",
        "    style=\"display: flex\">",
        "<div",
        "    class=\"-fsb-preset-4d8aded9 internal-fsb-allow-cursor internal-fsb-element internal-fsb-strict-layout\"",
        "    internal-fsb-class=\"FlowLayout\"",
        "    internal-fsb-event-no-propagate=\"1\"",
        "    internal-fsb-guid=\"078dc663\"",
        "    internal-fsb-name=\"Detail Box\"",
        "    style=\"background: rgba(85, 85, 85, 1); display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap\">",
        "",
        "<h2",
        "    class=\"-fsb-preset-12662a17 col-12 internal-fsb-element\"",
        "    contenteditable=\"true\"",
        "    internal-fsb-class=\"TextElement\"",
        "    internal-fsb-event-no-propagate=\"1\"",
        "    internal-fsb-guid=\"469b3758\"",
        "    internal-fsb-name=\"Title\"",
        "    style=\"-fsb-inherited-presets: 12662a17\"",
        "    internal-fsb-translation=\"\"",
        "    internal-fsb-seo-emphasizer=\"h2\">AI Generative Content<br>",
        "</h2>",
        "<div",
        "    class=\"-fsb-preset-49d77136 col-4 internal-fsb-allow-cursor internal-fsb-element internal-fsb-strict-layout offset-4\"",
        "    internal-fsb-class=\"FlowLayout\"",
        "    internal-fsb-event-no-propagate=\"1\"",
        "    internal-fsb-guid=\"17b8b01d\"",
        "    internal-fsb-name=\"HR\"",
        "    style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">",
        "",
        "</div>",
        "<h3",
        "    class=\"-fsb-preset-d2a8edc9 col-12 internal-fsb-element\"",
        "    contenteditable=\"true\"",
        "    internal-fsb-class=\"TextElement\"",
        "    internal-fsb-event-no-propagate=\"1\"",
        "    internal-fsb-guid=\"339642db\"",
        "    internal-fsb-name=\"Description\"",
        "    style=\"-fsb-inherited-presets: d2a8edc9\"",
        "    internal-fsb-translation=\"\"",
        "    internal-fsb-seo-emphasizer=\"h3\">While still under development, StackBlend is introducing the AI assist which will help you generate website content based on your guide and feedback.<div>",
        "</div>",
        "</h3>",
        "",
        "</div>",
        "</div>",
        "<div",
        "    class=\"col-12 col-lg-4 col-md-6 internal-fsb-allow-cursor internal-fsb-element internal-fsb-strict-layout\"",
        "    internal-fsb-class=\"Column\"",
        "    internal-fsb-guid=\"7e3e905b\"",
        "    internal-fsb-name=\"Column\"",
        "    internal-fsb-event-no-propagate=\"1\"",
        "    style=\"display: flex\">",
        "<div",
        "    class=\"-fsb-preset-4d8aded9 internal-fsb-allow-cursor internal-fsb-element internal-fsb-strict-layout\"",
        "    internal-fsb-class=\"FlowLayout\"",
        "    internal-fsb-event-no-propagate=\"1\"",
        "    internal-fsb-guid=\"a1c641c0\"",
        "    internal-fsb-name=\"Detail Box\"",
        "    style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">",
        "",
        "<h2",
        "    class=\"-fsb-preset-12662a17 col-12 internal-fsb-element\"",
        "    contenteditable=\"true\"",
        "    internal-fsb-class=\"TextElement\"",
        "    internal-fsb-event-no-propagate=\"1\"",
        "    internal-fsb-guid=\"50a10b02\"",
        "    internal-fsb-name=\"Title\"",
        "    style=\"-fsb-inherited-presets: 12662a17\"",
        "    internal-fsb-translation=\"\"",
        "    internal-fsb-seo-emphasizer=\"h2\">Teamwork Support</h2>",
        "<div",
        "    class=\"-fsb-preset-49d77136 col-4 internal-fsb-allow-cursor internal-fsb-element internal-fsb-strict-layout offset-4\"",
        "    internal-fsb-class=\"FlowLayout\"",
        "    internal-fsb-event-no-propagate=\"1\"",
        "    internal-fsb-guid=\"c40ac1e4\"",
        "    internal-fsb-name=\"HR\"",
        "    style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">",
        "",
        "</div>",
        "<h3",
        "    class=\"-fsb-preset-d2a8edc9 col-12 internal-fsb-element\"",
        "    contenteditable=\"true\"",
        "    internal-fsb-class=\"TextElement\"",
        "    internal-fsb-event-no-propagate=\"1\"",
        "    internal-fsb-guid=\"b3873655\"",
        "    internal-fsb-name=\"Description\"",
        "    style=\"-fsb-inherited-presets: d2a8edc9\"",
        "    internal-fsb-translation=\"\"",
        "    internal-fsb-seo-emphasizer=\"h3\">Since based on GitHub infrastructure, all members of your team can work together, accompanied with all audit procedures, toward every changes they did.<div>",
        "<br>",
        "</div>",
        "<div>Moreover, they can set the point of view of workspace for any business people, designers, or coders, where their works are combining into full-stack masterpiece, which the full-stack engineer can lead and maintain all of the enclosures by using StackBlend Studio right away.</div>",
        "</h3>",
        "</div>",
        "</div>",
        "<div",
        "    class=\"col-12 internal-fsb-allow-cursor internal-fsb-element internal-fsb-strict-layout offset-0\"",
        "    internal-fsb-class=\"Column\"",
        "    internal-fsb-guid=\"a0679e18\"",
        "    internal-fsb-name=\"Column\"",
        "    internal-fsb-event-no-propagate=\"1\"",
        "    style=\"display: flex\">",
        "<div",
        "    class=\"-fsb-preset-4d8aded9 internal-fsb-allow-cursor internal-fsb-element internal-fsb-strict-layout\"",
        "    internal-fsb-class=\"FlowLayout\"",
        "    internal-fsb-event-no-propagate=\"1\"",
        "    internal-fsb-guid=\"827e5e20\"",
        "    internal-fsb-name=\"Detail Box\"",
        "    style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap\">",
        "",
        "<h2",
        "    class=\"-fsb-preset-12662a17 col-12 internal-fsb-element\"",
        "    contenteditable=\"true\"",
        "    internal-fsb-class=\"TextElement\"",
        "    internal-fsb-event-no-propagate=\"1\"",
        "    internal-fsb-guid=\"4d7eec6b\"",
        "    internal-fsb-name=\"Title\"",
        "    style=\"-fsb-inherited-presets: 12662a17\"",
        "    internal-fsb-translation=\"\"",
        "    internal-fsb-seo-emphasizer=\"h2\">AI Copilot<br>",
        "</h2>",
        "<div",
        "    class=\"-fsb-preset-49d77136 col-4 internal-fsb-allow-cursor internal-fsb-element internal-fsb-strict-layout offset-4\"",
        "    internal-fsb-class=\"FlowLayout\"",
        "    internal-fsb-event-no-propagate=\"1\"",
        "    internal-fsb-guid=\"887e0268\"",
        "    internal-fsb-name=\"HR\"",
        "    style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">",
        "",
        "</div>",
        "<h3",
        "    class=\"-fsb-preset-d2a8edc9 col-12 internal-fsb-element\"",
        "    contenteditable=\"true\"",
        "    internal-fsb-class=\"TextElement\"",
        "    internal-fsb-event-no-propagate=\"1\"",
        "    internal-fsb-guid=\"de013dd4\"",
        "    internal-fsb-name=\"Description\"",
        "    style=\"-fsb-inherited-presets: d2a8edc9\"",
        "    internal-fsb-translation=\"\"",
        "    internal-fsb-seo-emphasizer=\"h3\">Meet your new AI Copilot, seamlessly integrated into our WYSIWYG full-stack editor to bridge the gap between visual design and production-ready code. Simply describe what you want to build, drag elements onto the canvas, or prompt changes in plain English, and the Copilot instantly generates responsive UI components, configures backend APIs, and sets up database schemas in real time. With bi-directional editing between the visual canvas and underlying codebase, you can eliminate repetitive boilerplate and ship complete full-stack web applications faster than ever.<br>",
        "</h3>",
        "<div",
        "    class=\"-fsb-self-be3cadc6 col-12 internal-fsb-element\"",
        "    internal-fsb-guid=\"d312d8a9\"",
        "    internal-fsb-name=\"Image 1\"",
        "    internal-fsb-event-no-propagate=\"1\"",
        "    internal-fsb-class=\"Image\"",
        "    style=\"-fsb-empty\"",
        "    alt=\"Create CSS3 animation using tracks and keyframes right on Bootstrap website.\"",
        "    internal-fsb-forward=\"true\">",
        "<img",
        "    src=\"https://assets.softenstorm.com/screenshot-6.jpg\"",
        "    class=\"\"",
        "    style=\"-fsb-reusable-id: be3cadc6; -fsb-reusable-name: ; -webkit-border-radius: 5px 5px 5px 5px; border-radius: 5px 5px 5px 5px\">",
        "</div>",
        "</div>",
        "</div>",
        "</div>",
        "<div",
        "    class=\"internal-fsb-allow-cursor internal-fsb-element internal-fsb-strict-layout row\"",
        "    internal-fsb-guid=\"e48e39d4\"",
        "    internal-fsb-name=\"Row 2\"",
        "    internal-fsb-class=\"Row\"",
        "    style=\"margin-bottom: 100px; padding-bottom: 20px\"",
        "    internal-fsb-event-no-propagate=\"1\">",
        "<div",
        "    class=\"col-12 internal-fsb-allow-cursor internal-fsb-element internal-fsb-strict-layout\"",
        "    internal-fsb-class=\"Column\"",
        "    internal-fsb-guid=\"e48e39d4-column\"",
        "    internal-fsb-name=\"Column\"",
        "    internal-fsb-event-no-propagate=\"1\">",
        "",
        "<div",
        "    style=\"-ms-overflow-x: hidden; -ms-overflow-y: hidden; -webkit-border-radius: 10px 10px 10px 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 0px 5px 10px rgba(85, 85, 85, 1); border-radius: 10px 10px 10px 10px; box-shadow: 0px 5px 10px rgba(85, 85, 85, 1); overflow-x: hidden; overflow-y: hidden; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; width: 100%\"",
        "    class=\"internal-fsb-allow-cursor internal-fsb-element\"",
        "    internal-fsb-guid=\"40bdc3b7\"",
        "    internal-fsb-name=\"Footer Section\"",
        "    internal-fsb-event-no-propagate=\"1\"",
        "    internal-fsb-class=\"Rectangle\">",
        "<div",
        "    class=\"col-12 internal-fsb-allow-cursor internal-fsb-element internal-fsb-strict-layout\"",
